OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with clear periods
OL,8,Falthough clouding over the across the
OL,9,Feast later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FSome brightness across the
OL,12,Fwest at first otherwise often cloudy
OL,13,Fwith the chance of the odd shower.
OL,14,FWarmest with the best chance of
OL,15,Fbrighter spells in the west.
