OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FQuite
OL,6,Fcloudy at times with the chance of
OL,7,Fsome showers or occasional rain, but
OL,8,Falso some bright warm spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Chance of fresher winds
OL,10,Fand more persistent rain on Friday.
